{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26974","headline":"酬田卿书斋即事见寄 · 姚合","name":"酬田卿书斋即事见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽斋琴思静，晚下紫宸朝。\n旧隐同溪远，周行隔品遥。\n深槐蝉唧唧，疎竹雨萧萧。\n不是相寻懒，烦君举酒瓢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}